WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.400
[Upbeat music]
Meet ITerview.

00:01.400 --> 00:03.750
AI-powered interview practice for IT students.

00:04.160 --> 00:07.100
Try a sample or ask the guest guide
about your track.

00:07.890 --> 00:09.950
Then sign up with your school email.

00:10.990 --> 00:12.500
Pick your target role.

00:12.900 --> 00:16.550
Check your confidence and microphone,
then take a starting assessment.

00:17.650 --> 00:20.000
Set a difficulty or drill one skill.

00:20.320 --> 00:24.150
Practice out loud in personalized,
technical, and behavioral sets.

00:24.590 --> 00:28.020
Track each question and see your progress
in one focused workspace.

00:28.190 --> 00:30.110
Press Answer or Space to speak.

00:30.220 --> 00:33.650
Review your transcript and fix misheard
words before you submit.

00:34.020 --> 00:37.500
Review the conversation, then see
what worked and what to improve.

00:38.250 --> 00:43.250
Meet Nikki, your voice guide for
resuming practice, reviewing feedback,
and finding your next step.

00:43.710 --> 00:46.560
Save questions for quick drills
in Practice Again.

00:46.900 --> 00:49.720
Open History to revisit
your sessions and scores.

00:50.180 --> 00:53.470
Compare your starting and progress scores,
and track your confidence.

00:53.740 --> 00:57.000
See your breakdown for clarity,
correctness, and completeness.

00:57.270 --> 01:01.000
Ask your AI Coach what to practice next,
based on your progress.

01:01.880 --> 01:04.720
Get ready for the real thing.
Start practicing free.
